Inside The Golem Workshop~
This spacious workshop has numerous tables used in the construction of cloth
golems.  One some tables the burlap is neatly stacked, ready to be cut.
On other tables, partially constructed cloth golems can be found in various
stages of completion.  Burlap dust fills the air.
